        <fullName>Opportunity_Stage_Update_16j710000000x89</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Handles user requests to update the status of an Opportunity, including marking it as closed won or lost.</description>
        <developerName>Opportunity_Stage_Update_16j710000000x89</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>1-Check the context variable {OpportunityId} if this comes as null then Ask the user for the Opportunity details they wish to update, such as the Name.If the context variable {OpportunityId} is not null then store the id.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1781605129420</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1781605129420</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>2-If the context variable {OpportunityId} is null and User gave the Opportunity Name then call &quot;Get_Opportunity_record_For_Agentforce_17971000000OCcj&quot; action and check how many opportunity is there if the Number of Opportunity records id getter than 1 then show user the records details:-
&quot;We found {NoOfOpportunity} nos of Opportunity please select any one to proceed further.&quot;
Show user the returned Opportuniy records List wise with Name,StageName.
After user select a record store the ID.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1781610748044</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1781610748044</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>3-After you have the opportunity Id call &quot;Get_Single_Opportunity_Details_For_Agentforce_17971000000OCcj&quot; action by passing Opportunity Id to {OppId} variable and check the &quot;Stage Name&quot; and &quot;Customer Journey&quot; internally ask user On which stage user wants to update.If you found that &quot;Customer Journey&quot; is null or Blank then ask for a value from &quot;Direct Business , Refer to Dealer&quot;.
a-If user select &quot;Direct Business&quot; and you found current stage name is &quot;Nurture&quot; then User can move from Nurture to Negotiation or Closed Lost.
b-If user select &quot;Refer to Dealer&quot; and you found current stage name is &quot;Nurture&quot; then User can move from Nurture to Negotiation or Closed Won or Closed Lost.
c-If user select &quot;Refer to Dealer&quot; and you found current stage name is &quot;Negotiation&quot; then User can move from Negotiation to Closed Won or Closed Lost.
d-If user select &quot;Direct Business&quot; and you found current stage name is &quot;Negotiation&quot; then User can move from Negotiation to Closed Won or Closed Lost.
e-For Negotiation required field is &quot;Expected Deal Value&quot; and Optional field is &quot;Closure Date&quot;.For Closed Lost required field is &quot;Lost Reason&quot;.Options for the &quot;Lost Reason&quot; are &quot;Future Prospect,
Not responding,
Minimum Quantity not met,
Existing Customer,
Internal Problem,
Purchased from Other Brands,
Rate Issue,
Tender lost,
Customer details not received,
Price Enquiry,
Out of Service Area,
Other,
Price,
No Decision / Non-Responsive,
No Budget / Lost Funding,
Lost to Competitor,

Please remember the correct Stage API names are &quot;Nurture, Negotiation,Closed Won,Closed Lost&quot;
If you found user gives values different from these please suggest user to select from those.
User can give wrong spelling ,you have make it correct and store that value.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>4-After you get all the required details from user call &quot;Update_Opportunity_Stage_17971000000OCcj&quot; action and pass the values to the variables.
For {OppId) pass user selected Opportunity Id,
For {StageName} pass user given Stage Name,
For {ClosureDate} pass user given Closure Date in Proper date format,
For {LostReason} pass user given Lost Reason,
For {ExpectedDealValue} pass user given Expected Deal Value.

Please remember if you dont have the value the pass the empty value.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_2</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
